alue="지칭 관계는 모델이 생성&lt;br&gt;틀린 ID/시점은 코드로 검사&lt;br&gt;정정: 관련 장면 다시 해석" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="864" y="1280" width="296.12" height="91.05000000000001" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="유리: 복잡한 시각 표현과 말의 맥락을 함께 활용&lt;br&gt;대가: 시간/대상 오결합 가능; 관련 장면 재해석&lt;br&gt;선택: 낯선 화면과 자유로운 표현이 중요할 때" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="79" y="2125" width="559.08" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" value="B  두 근거를 생산한 뒤 결합" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="285" width="438.2" height="46.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="Interaction Manager가 기록한 화면/포인터/발화 시점" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="350" width="593.48" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e42" value="1  같은 범위의 근거와 수정 버전" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1377" y="555" width="302.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e44" value="2  화면/포인터/시점" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1357" y="830" width="189.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e46" value="2  발화/시점/이전 참조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1982" y="830" width="218.96" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" value="3  Coordinator 경유: 화면 후보" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1362" y="1140" width="316.88" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e50" value="3  Coordinator 경유: 지시 조건" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2112" y="1235" width="316.88" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" value="4  Coordinator 경유: 결합 결과/버전&lt;br&gt;없음/복수/표현 밖 → 해당 지시 질문" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1637" y="1510" width="364.04" height="54.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e54" value="미해결: 질문 또는 필요한 근거 재생산" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1347" y="1280" width="344.96" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e58" value="추론 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1607" y="925" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e60" value="후보 결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1362" y="910" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e62" value="추론 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2097" y="925" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e64" value="조건 결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2277" y="910" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e66" value="추론" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1862" y="1010" width="44.0" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e68" value="결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1917" y="1050" width="44.0" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e69" value="Coordinator가 두 결과의 버전 확인; Join Engine은 조건 결합만 수행&lt;br&gt;원본 언어/시각 해석을 Join Engine으로 옮기거나 모델을 복제하지 않음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="1850" width="732.4" height="60.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e71" value="유리: 시간/위치 결합 근거와 정정 범위를 명시&lt;br&gt;대가: 두 생산의 누락/지연; 표현 밖 영역은 재지칭&lt;br&gt;선택: 순차 지칭과 반복 정정이 많을 때" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1327" y="2125" width="587.6" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e72" value="공통 마무리: Request Controller 현재 검사 → Task Manager → Agent Gateway → Downstream Agent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2270" width="1201.72" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e73" value="접수/결과 반환 → Response Manager → Interaction Manager의 실제 표시/음성. 미해결이면 실행 대신 질문." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2310" width="1245.28" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e74" value="검정: 공통 / 파랑: A 고유 / 초록: B 고유. 실선: 요청/전달 / 점선: 결과. 네모: 이름 / 원통: 상태 / 육각형: 외부 의존." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2370" width="1205.76" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="같은 이름의 반복 상자는 동일 Component. 비교 부분의 책임을 펼친 그림. 별도 process 표기가 없으면 논리 분해. 모델 가중치는 한 벌; 이익은 조건부 설계 가설, 미측정." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2410" width="1644.66" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
